  "title": "Ukraine Launches Largest Drone Attack on Russia in Summer",
  "summary": "Ukraine intensifies its drone attacks on Russia, with attacks targeting infrastructure and civilian areas, while Moscow reports a significant escalation in drone attacks and casualties.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "A Ukrainian drone attack on a Russian oil refinery in Nizhnekamsk killed at least 13 people, including a child and eight Central Asian nationals.",
